/*
 * BENCmouth GUI - Windows resources
 *
 * The icon lives here and only here. The CLI is a console program that nobody
 * double-clicks, so giving bm.exe a 370 KB icon would be 370 KB spent on
 * something no one sees.
 *
 * Resource ID 1: Windows uses the lowest-numbered icon in the file as the
 * application icon, in Explorer and in the title bar.
 */

1 ICON "assets/icon/bencmouth.ico"
